K325T stage 3: the TG68K of MiSTer-devel/Minimig-AGA_MiSTer master 7d5d3c2 (files replaced as a whole)
TG68KdotC_Kernel.vhd, TG68K_ALU.vhd, TG68K_Pack.vhd at their last upstream changes: c55ecd9 (#276
"Cycle exact 68EC020 (A1200 speed)": opcode / CACR / long-word outputs for cpu_cycles.v and the 32-bit
chip cycles), ec1353d (#277, 68030 + MMU: the new TG68K_MMU030.vhd is in K325T/cpu020/), a189426
("take the memory word last in the long chains"), 09226f7 (68EC020 instruction cache).
Only the TG68K changes; the 68000 (fx68k) is not affected.
